{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"1fb177a9a4dc16120b4bc7ca9c0eb4e68f9119d2","node_id":"C_kwDOULC0UdoAKDFmYjE3N2E5YTRkYzE2MTIwYjRiYzdjYTljMGViNGU2OGY5MTE5ZDI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:35Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11035030b91fe5abe921171e5678adca92812b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-macos-skills/git/trees/11035030b91fe5abe921171e5678adca92812b3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-macos-skills/git/commits/1fb177a9a4dc16120b4bc7ca9c0eb4e68f9119d2